OL,8,G0900 Police Interceptors
OL,9,     FIn this high-octane episode,
OL,10,     Fseveral units get on the tail of a
OL,11,     Fwhite van that's been gunning it
OL,12,     Faround town at four times the
OL,13,     Fspeed limit.
OL,14,G1000 Police Interceptors
OL,15,     FDog handler Chris finds himself on
OL,16,     Fthe tail of a runaway Renault. The
OL,17,     Fmotor is flying and when it
OL,18,     Fhurtles round a blind bend, Chris
OL,19,     Fknows what's coming, the car rolls
OL,20,     Fonto its roof.
