OL,5,G1100 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FOn patrol in Derbyshire, the
OL,7,     Ftraffic cops tackle a huge variety
OL,8,     Fof criminals, ranging from drunk
OL,9,     For drugged drivers to violent
OL,10,     Fcounty lines drug dealers and
OL,11,     Forganised crime gangs.
OL,12,G1155 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FOne officer narrowly escapes
OL,14,     Fserious injury as he attempts to
OL,15,     Fopen the driver's door only for
OL,16,     Fthe suspect to suddenly speed off
OL,17,     Fpulling him along the road.
