OL,10,     Fup fatal.
OL,11,G1355 Traffic Cops
OL,12,     FTraffic cop Karl Jackson is
OL,13,     Falerted to a possible disqualified
OL,14,     Fdriver when a passing car pings up
OL,15,     Fon his ANPR system. He flags the
OL,16,     Fdriver, who fails to stop, and a
OL,17,     Fpursuit begins.
